,{"id":"n14259-1-6-2","ko":"아니. 고등학생일 당시엔 서로 몰랐어.","zh":"不是。我们高中时根本不认识彼此。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"고등학생일","meaning":"高中生","explanation":"고등학생：高中生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"고등학생","audio":"/audio/b4982ece8446557ab298.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23381","senseId":"1","lemma":"고등학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고등학생일","audio":"/audio/6ab2b3e3f19267c881b6.mp3"}},{"text":"당시엔","meaning":"当时，那时","explanation":"당시：当时，那时；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"당시","audio":"/audio/53613ed0216550ac6d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14259","senseId":"1","lemma":"당시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당시엔","audio":"/audio/ee805bfecd8e947de709.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互。","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"몰랐어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰랐어","audio":"/audio/b46cbb5cb7db55cf60a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"b4982ece8446557a","term"